OL,3,GNEWSARadical changes to Essex councils
OL,4,Adelayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision on whether a radical reshape
OL,7,Fof councils in Essex will go ahead is
OL,8,Fnow expected early next year, the
OL,9,Fgovernment has said.
OL,11,FPlans to abolish Essex's fifteen
OL,12,Fcouncils and replace them with five
OL,13,Fsuper councils were withdrawn in
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FBut on Thursday, the government said
OL,17,Flocal government reorganisation (LGR)
OL,18,Fin the county was under review.
OL,19,FMinister Jim McMahon told the Commons
OL,20,F"all options and proposals will remain
OL,21,Funder consideration".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
