OL,3,GNEWSARadical changes to Essex councils
OL,4,Adelayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have described the
OL,7,Fgovernment's handling of LGR as "a
OL,8,Ffarce". Essex County Council leader
OL,9,FPeter Harris, of Reform UK, said it
OL,10,Fneeded to "get on with the serious
OL,11,Fbusiness of running a council".
